            "review_title": "Review at Lady Buddha Rooftop Cafe & Restaurant",
            "review_text": "nrm77\nLondon, United Kingdom1020 contributions\n0\nFantastic view and service!\nJul 2019\nI was at the Lady Buddha Rooftop Cafe on my way back to our hotel from the Son Tra peninsula. We stopped by here upon the recommendation of the cab driver and we have to admit, we were very pleasantly surprised. The views were fantastic - watching the fishing vessel and fishermen come back ashore was really awesome! The restaurant is located on the top floor of the Dan Oasis Hotel, and we ordered ourselves an avocado salad. It was really awesome! We doubled it up with some awesome fried egg here. Really enjoyed the meal, the vibe and the views!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 25, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
